    <!-- ================================================== the faults
         Sections 5.6 to 5.9. NOT SENT is the shared label for everything that failed
         before the instruction landed, the same shape as NOTHING RECORDED and COULD
         NOT WRITE: the user's first question is where their sentence went.

         The passphrase file is named because naming it is the fix, and this is the
         one path in the product that M4-copy's never-a-path rule does not govern:
         that rule is about the user's own storage on the phone. The passphrase
