         A plurals resource with an explicit "two" case (section 5.11). English
         in Android has only "one" and "other", so the "two" case cannot live in
         the plurals resource and is its own string, chosen in code when the
         count is exactly two. The plurals resource carries the rest. -->
    <string name="m8_ambiguous_title_two">Two projects match.</string>
    <plurals name="m8_ambiguous_title">
        <item quantity="other">%1$d projects match.</item>
    </plurals>
